# Grafo Kapso Life Deportes

Leer `kapso/docs/graph_architecture.md` y `kapso/docs/staff_hermes_bridge.md`.

Skill obligatoria antes de publicar: `.agents/skills/kapso-graph-guard/SKILL.md`

## Validación pre-upload (obligatorio)

```bash
node kapso/scripts/validate-graph-lifedeportes.js kapso/workflow_lifedeportes_sales_inbound_v10.json
```

No ejecutar `update-graph` si falla.

## Grafo activo

`workflow_lifedeportes_sales_inbound_v10.json` — 16 nodos: carril cliente + carril staff reducido al forwarder. Sin nodos huérfanos de v7/v8/v9.

## Carril cliente

Sin cambios de filosofía: classify → wait_customer_burst → decide → ensure-crm → resolve-business-hours → vendedor. Sin decides post vendedor.

## Carril staff (2026-09-16: vive en Hermes local)

```
route-user-entry [staff] → wait_staff_burst (1s) → decide burst [timeout] → staff-hermes-forwarder
   → webhook Hermes `staff-assistant` → wait_staff_lane → reengancha burst
```

Kapso **no** crea CRM/SO ni parsea listas: eso es del agente staff de Hermes.

No reintroducir: `agent_1780762885818`, `detect-staff-upload-command`, `route-staff-entry`,
`validate-staff-write` → `build-quote-payload` → `odoo-create-lead-and-so`, nómina, ni
`route-staff-registration`. Todas están en `ARCHIVED_FUNCTION_NAMES` (`scripts/validate-graph-lifedeportes.js`)
con código archivado en `kapso/functions/_archive/`.

## Sync

`get-graph` → validar → `update-graph` con lock_version, o el camino único
`bash kapso/scripts/deploy_graph_kb_progressive.sh`. El embed de staff es no-op
(`embed_agent_knowledge.js --agent staff` → `RETIRED_AGENTS`).
